[en.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE]
Worship the Holy Harmonious Sites

[en.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE_desc]
It doesn’t matter if you mean well or not, it doesn’t matter if it is the Tree of Harmony or Treehouse of Harmony or something else, as long as you have harmony in your kind heart, your redemption will be granted one day.

[en.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE_THREAT]
Blessing of Harmony

[en.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE_TOOLTIP]
Bring the §YBlessing of Harmony§ to the world!

[zh.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE]
朝拜谐律圣迹

[zh.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE_desc]
无论你的意图是好是坏，无论你朝拜的是谐律之树还是谐律树屋还是其他什么，只要你善良的心中有谐律，你的救赎总有一天会到来。

[zh.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE_THREAT]
谐律的赐福

[zh.DECISION_HARMONY_TREE_TOOLTIP]
为世界带来 §Y谐律的赐福§!
